    {
      "bbox": [
        301,
        621,
        1217,
        685
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Westway is the single most important capital project in the City; and\nWhereas, This Administration has given top priority to the advancement of this project;\nand",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.285,
          "min": -1.27
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 36,
          "mean": -0.0041,
          "min": -0.0602
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9492,
        "area_px": 59995,
        "density": 0.15821,
        "chars": 170,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.91
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        302,
        687,
        1217,
        732
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Westway received approval from the Secretary of Transportation, enabling\nthe City and State to proceed with planning and development.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2353,
          "min": -1.2032
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0125,
          "min": -0.2266
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7730,
        "area_px": 42412,
        "density": 0.18226,
        "chars": 142,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        302,
        732,
        1219,
        776
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is\nhereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.204,
          "min": -1.0437
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0005
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 28,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0025
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5497,
        "area_px": 41580,
        "density": 0.1322,
        "chars": 108,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.65
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        802,
        1240,
        899
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. A Westway Expediting Council is hereby created, consisting of the First Deputy Mayor, who shall be Chairman, the Transportation Administrator, the Chairman of the City Planning Commission, the Corporation Counsel and the Director of the Office of Management and Budget.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2347,
          "min": -1.2221
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.1271,
          "min": -0.1271
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0234
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12796,
        "area_px": 90552,
        "density": 0.14131,
        "chars": 280,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.88
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        324,
        892,
        1240,
        963
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. The Transportation Administrator will coordinate all technical activities relating to the expeditious preparation of the official roadway map and the Planning Commission Chairman will coordinate land use and planning activities.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2153,
          "min": -1.1768
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.1129,
          "min": -0.1129
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0088,
          "min": -0.2579
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10516,
        "area_px": 66384,
        "density": 0.15841,
        "chars": 233,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.16
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        324,
        958,
        1240,
        1008
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Corporation Counsel and the Director of the Office of Management and Budget\nwill provide appropriate support services.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1864,
          "min": -1.0582
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0004
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.0059,
          "min": -0.114
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5758,
        "area_px": 47022,
        "density": 0.12245,
        "chars": 122,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.19
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        324,
        1002,
        1242,
        1161
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. All agencies are directed to assign top policy level personnel to assist in this effort when requested by the Council. In particular, the Commissioner of Sanitation, the Administrator of Environmental Protection, the Commissioner of Water Resources, the Administrator of Municipal Services and the Commissioner of Ports and Terminals are requested to attend Council meetings as required, and work directly with the members to carry out the goals and objectives of building Westway under the overall direction of the First Deputy Mayor or his designated representative.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1972,
          "min": -1.0984
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
